     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "This is important because it allows individuals to make an informed decision about whether or not they want to participate in the study. Informed consent also ensures ethical principles such as respect for autonomy and beneficence are upheld."
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "To ensure individuals are aware of the potential risks and benefits of the research"
